WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come to all fours, wrists under shoulders, knees under hips, spine neutral like a tabletop.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Inhale: drop the belly, lift the chest and tailbone, and let the gaze rise gently - this is Cow.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Exhale: press the floor away, round the spine toward the ceiling, and let the head hang - this is Cat.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Continue flowing between the two shapes, one movement per breath, for eight to ten rounds.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Finish in a neutral tabletop, feeling warmth along the whole spine.
